---
title: Automated Agent Design Loop (ADAS / AFlow / GEPA / DGM style)
---
flowchart TD
    M["Meta-agent / optimiser<br/>proposes a candidate:<br/>agent code, workflow, or prompt"]:::llm
    E["Evaluate candidate<br/>run on benchmark or metric,<br/>collect trajectories"]:::code
    A[("Archive of candidates<br/>and scores")]:::store
    S["Select what to expand<br/>AFlow: MCTS<br/>GEPA: Pareto front<br/>HGM: clade metaproductivity"]:::code
    R["Mutate<br/>reflect on trajectories in<br/>natural language, rewrite"]:::llm
    O["Best discovered agent<br/>or prompt"]:::code
    X["Caveats: search cost,<br/>overfitting to the metric,<br/>safety of self-modifying code"]:::risk

    M -->|candidate| E
    E -->|score + traces| A
    A -->|history| S
    S -->|chosen parent| R
    R -->|new variant, repeat| M
    A -->|best entry when budget ends| O
    E -.->|optimiser sees the metric| X

    classDef llm fill:#DBEAFE,stroke:#2563EB,color:#111
    classDef code fill:#DCFCE7,stroke:#16A34A,color:#111
    classDef store fill:#F3F4F6,stroke:#6B7280,color:#111
    classDef risk fill:#FEE2E2,stroke:#DC2626,color:#111
    linkStyle default stroke:#555555
